[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 29763.03, "timestamp": "08:16:03", "text": "贊助了他們，或是其他什麼原因，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 29768.07, "timestamp": "08:16:08", "text": "不太確定，但確實很酷。例如，我和朋友聊天，AI 也參與了進來，它會進行監控，但同時也需要所有者的許可。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 29789.03, "timestamp": "08:16:29", "text": "嗯，它也有類似的同意機制。例如，如果所有者說“開啟"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 29789.381, "timestamp": "08:16:29", "author": "@BlueCatClips", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MHfCoSTa6tUSyjerOzFGfbq60IJ8vNLr6lhFjl1i9ZBbSK41X77dzWfd45XMLlaymFrGMR5gNJ8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "same man same"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 29795.19, "timestamp": "08:16:35", "text": "隱私模式”，那麼無論所有者用手機和別人"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 29799.138, "timestamp": "08:16:39", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i am.back"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 29801.03, "timestamp": "08:16:41", "text": "聊天，或者使用應用程序，所有內容都會被加密，AI 不會查看，也不會採取任何行動。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 29804.708, "timestamp": "08:16:44", "text": "嗯，直接"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 29810.788, "timestamp": "08:16:50", "text": "忽略它就行了。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 29814.465, "timestamp": "08:16:54", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "owo new guest"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 29816.468, "timestamp": "08:16:56", "text": "是啊，就是那種「別理它」之類的。這挺酷的。確實挺酷的，也挺瘋狂的。我還跟人工智慧聊了聊。我覺得它現在不記得"}]